# Keep only HDL sources, constraints, and simulation inputs/configuration.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Verilog sources and testbenches
!*.v
!*.vh
!*.sv
!*.svh

# Vivado constraints
!*.xdc

# Simulation memory data and waveform configuration
!*.mem
!*.hex
!*.wcfg

# Vivado 2020.2 generated directories (may contain generated HDL/XDC)
**/.Xil/
**/*.cache/
**/*.gen/
**/*.runs/
**/*.sim/
**/*.hw/
**/ip_user_files/
**/xsim.dir/

# Agents.md
AGENTS.md
# 로컬 Vivado 프로젝트 및 복사본
/master/spi_master/
